    "reviewerBrief": ["Review each locale and capability independently in the listed order.", "A market route is not a locale or translation-support signal.", "All copy is currently unsupported; do not fill a translation field from memory or machine output.", "Keep locale IDs, market IDs, enum values, placeholders, URLs, hashes, model names, and source excerpts exact.", "Record findings before editing copy.", "A machine pass, test pass, or model opinion is not native review evidence."],
